339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( IaaS provides virtualized computing resources over the internet. It includes fundamental services such as virtual machines, networks, and storage. Users manage the operating systems, applications, and runtime environments, while the provider manages the infrastructure.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
340 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Example: A startup launching a web application might use OpenStack or Amazon EC2 to provision virtual machines and configure storage and network settings without purchasing physical hardware.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
