/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Keystone is the identity service used for authentication and high-level authorization. It provides a central directory of users mapped to the OpenStack services they can access. Keystone supports multiple forms of authentication and is essential for securing the OpenStack environment.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
