/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( A Dell R720 server using eight 600 GB SAS drives in RAID-10 may yield ~2.3 TB usable Cinder volume capacity. However, scaling beyond a few nodes introduces redundancy and capacity limitations.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
