715 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Platform9 simplifies such integrations by allowing storage arrays to be configured directly from its dashboard or CLI, enabling administrators to assign volume types \(e.g., SSD-backed, SAS-backed\) tailored to specific workloads. These volumes can then be attached to instances and managed seamlessly by users.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
